add_unique_key | 42501: must be owner of table parent
drop_unique_key | 42501: must be owner of table parent
drop_unique_key_by_name | 42501: must be owner of table parent
add_foreign_key onto a table it does not own | 42501: must be owner of table child
add_regular_foreign_key | 42501: must be owner of table child
drop_foreign_key | 42501: must be owner of table child
drop_foreign_key_by_name | 42501: must be owner of table child
add_for_portion_of_view | 42501: must be owner of table parent
drop_for_portion_of_view | 42501: must be owner of table parent
