drop_current_view | 42501: must be owner of table parent
add_synchronize_temporal_columns_trigger | 42501: must be owner of table parent
drop_synchronize_temporal_columns_trigger | 42501: must be owner of table parent
add_system_versioning | 42501: must be owner of table child
