set_system_time_era_excluded_columns | 42501: must be owner of table sv
rebuild_system_versioning_views | 42501: must be owner of table sv
nothing changed on ow_owner's tables | true
--- part 2: a member of the owner role passes the ownership check
add_era as a member of the owner role | ok
set_era_ephemeral_columns as a member | ok
--- part 3: a foreign key needs REFERENCES on the referenced table
own child, parent without REFERENCES | 42501: permission denied for table parent
own child, parent with REFERENCES | ok
--- part 4: a catalog row whose referencing table is gone (R6): only the referenced table owner may remove it
another role removes the dangling row | 42501: must be owner of table parent
the referenced table owner removes it | ok
--- part 5: as native DROP ... CASCADE, the parent owner removes a dependent foreign key owned by another role
drop the referencing key directly, not owning it | 42501: must be owner of table child
drop_era CASCADE (views, keys, dependent foreign keys) | ok
